{"synopsis":"Setelah dengan patuh mengikuti “Demon King’s Standards,” aku malah dibunuh oleh para pahlawan.\n\nApa-apaan ini, tower dan aku sekarang jadi tempat berburu khusus untuk para pahlawan?!\n\nKini dengan kesempatan hidup kedua berkat regresi, persetan dengan “Demon King’s Standards” itu!\n\nInilah kisah tentang bagaimana sang raja iblis keras kepala(?) Berje berjuang untuk bertahan hidup di era brutal ini, tanpa menjadi mangsa lagi!","alternative_title":"마왕인데 용사가 너무 많음","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Midnight Studio","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"e25bb980-8320-43b5-9eb8-fdbf7834ec76","number":"41","chapter":"41","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_1/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_2/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_3/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_4/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_5/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_6/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_7/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_8/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_9/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_10/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_11/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_12/12.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4df769c3-3209-4745-a2c2-e547d44e080a/chapter_ch_13/13.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4d